Hi Dave,

Try this:

ggplot(mydata, aes(x=strength/2, y = val, fill = widget, width=strength)) +
geom_bar(position="fill", stat="identity") +

facet_grid(side1 ~ side2) +
coord_polar("y") +
opts(axis.text.x = theme_blank())

Hope you get what you want.

SW

